<%- include('partials/head') %>

<div class="container narrow">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>A job board with nothing hidden</h1>
    <p>
      Karmaadhar Jobs exists because looking for work should not require guessing. Every listing
      here shows the salary band, the work mode, the experience expected and the contact point for
      the hiring team.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>For candidates</h2>
    <p>
      Search by keyword, location, category or work mode. Open any role to read the full brief, then
      apply with your details and a short note — no account, no resume parser, no dark patterns.
    </p>

    <h2>For employers</h2>
    <p>
      Post a role from the <a href="/post">post a job</a> page. Listings publish immediately and
      appear in the feed for candidates browsing by category and work mode. If salary is undisclosed,
      the listing says so plainly.
    </p>

    <h2>How the data works</h2>
    <p>
      Listings and applications are stored by this application itself. The jobs feed is also
      available as JSON at <a href="/api/jobs">/api/jobs</a> for anyone who wants to build on top of it.
    </p>

    <ul class="stats stats--inline">
      <li><strong><%= stats.jobs %></strong><span>open roles</span></li>
      <li><strong><%= stats.companies %></strong><span>hiring teams</span></li>
      <li><strong><%= stats.applications %></strong><span>applications sent</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
